  "root_cause": "The client.py module captures the config in the variable _client_config at import time, which is initialized by get_config(). This causes the client to use the stale config with the old timeout value, even after reset_config() is called, because _client_config is not updated.",
  "code_commitments": [
    "get_db_url must retrieve the current config from get_config()",
    "get_timeout must retrieve the current config from get_config()"
