  "risk_check": "This fix could still fail if get_config() is called multiple times within a single operation and the config changes between calls, but since get_config() is called fresh in each function, it is safe. The fix is safe because it ensures the latest config is fetched on each access, preventing stale data. No additional revisions are necessary.",
